    description: '吳福（约约1421年），明人物。明朝（1368—1644年）是朱元璋推翻元朝建立的汉族王朝，定都应天（南京）后迁都北京。永乐盛世、郑和下西洋彰显国威，后期宦官专权、党争激烈，终被农民起义推翻。关于其生平与事迹的记载，散见于相关史籍文献之中，反映了当时的历史风貌与社会环境。',
    descriptionEn: '吳福 (c. c. 1421) was a figure of the 明 period. The Ming dynasty (1368–1644) was founded by Zhu Yuanzhang, with its capital first at Nanjing then Beijing. The Yongle era and Zheng He\'s voyages projected Chinese power overseas, while later periods saw eunuch dominance and factional strife. Records of their life and deeds are preserved in historical texts and documents, reflecting the historical context and social environment of the era.',
